{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b1d2a3u4-t5h6-7890-bdmg-auth-login-reset",
    "name": "BD Management · Auth · login / reset password",
    "description": "bd-management 登录（HTTP）与 Admin 重置密码（gRPC 效果验收）场景契约测试。\n\n**场景矩阵**：`docs/bd-auth-testing.md`\n\n| 目录 | 覆盖 |\n|------|------|\n| A | Login 正向 L-01~L-03 |\n| B | Login 异常 L-E01~L-E07 |\n| C | Reset 后登录 R-02（需先跑 scripts/bd-grpc-reset-password.sh） |\n| D | E2E F-01 / F-02 |\n\n**本地**：`apiBase=http://127.0.0.1:8080`，`allow-plain-data=true`\n\n**运行**：`npm run pm:bd-auth:local`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "apiBase", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8080" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "loginData", "value": "" },
    { "key": "_oldToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "_newPassword", "value": "" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept', value: 'application/json' });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Content-Type', value: 'application/json' });",
          "",
          "function buildLoginData(email, password, brokerId) {",
          "  const plain = {",
          "    email: String(email || ''),",
          "    password: String(password || ''),",
          "    broker_id: Number(brokerId || 1)",
          "  };",
          "  return JSON.stringify(plain);",
          "}",
          "",
          "const email = pm.environment.get('bdEmail') || pm.collectionVariables.get('bdEmail');",
          "const password = pm.environment.get('bdPassword') || pm.collectionVariables.get('bdPassword');",
          "const brokerId = pm.environment.get('brokerId') || pm.collectionVariables.get('brokerId') || '1';",
          "if (email && password) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('loginData', JSON.stringify(buildLoginData(email, password, brokerId)));",
          "}",
          "",
          "const token = (pm.environment.get('accessToken') || pm.collectionVariables.get('accessToken') || '').trim();",
          "const name = (pm.info && pm.info.requestName) || '';",
          "const needsAuth = /logout|change_password|ping|鉴权|Bearer/i.test(name) || /\\/logout|\\/change_password|\\/bd-users\\/ping/.test(pm.request.url.toString());",
          "if (needsAuth && token && !/无\\s*Token|无\\s*auth|旧\\s*token/i.test(name)) {",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Authorization', value: 'Bearer ' + token });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const ct = (pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '').toLowerCase();",
          "const text = pm.response.text() || '';",
          "if (ct.includes('text/html') || text.trimStart().startsWith('<!')) {",
          "  pm.test('响应应为 JSON API', () => pm.expect.fail('got HTML'));",
          "  return;",
          "}",
          "try {",
          "  const body = pm.response.json();",
          "  if (body && typeof body.token === 'string' && body.token.length > 0 && body.ret_code === 0) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.token);",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.token);",
          "  }",
          "} catch (e) { /* ignore */ }"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 Setup",
      "description": "检查必填环境变量。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "S01 检查 bdEmail / bdPassword",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const email = (pm.environment.get('bdEmail') || '').trim();",
                  "const password = (pm.environment.get('bdPassword') || '').trim();",
                  "if (!email || !password) {",
                  "  throw new Error('请在环境 bd-management-local 中填写 bdEmail / bdPassword');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('环境变量已配置', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect((pm.environment.get('bdEmail') || '').trim()).to.not.eql('');",
                  "  pm.expect((pm.environment.get('bdPassword') || '').trim()).to.not.eql('');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{apiBase}}/v1/health"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "A · Login 正向 [ok]",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[ok] L-01 正确账密登录",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const email = pm.environment.get('bdEmail');",
                  "const password = pm.environment.get('bdPassword');",
                  "const brokerId = pm.environment.get('brokerId') || '1';",
                  "const plain = JSON.stringify({ email, password, broker_id: Number(brokerId) });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('loginData', JSON.stringify(plain));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('ret_code=0', () => pm.expect(body.ret_code).to.eql(0));",
                  "pm.test('双 token 一致非空', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.eql('');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.result).to.be.an('object');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.result.token).to.eql(body.token);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('mustChangePassword 为 boolean', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.result).to.have.property('mustChangePassword');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.result.mustChangePassword).to.be.a('boolean');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.token);",
                  "pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"data\": {{loginData}},\n  \"broker_id\": {{brokerId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{apiBase}}/api/v1/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[ok] L-02 响应壳字段",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const email = pm.environment.get('bdEmail');",
                  "const password = pm.environment.get('bdPassword');",
                  "const brokerId = pm.environment.get('brokerId') || '1';",
                  "const plain = JSON.stringify({ email, password, broker_id: Number(brokerId) });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('loginData', JSON.stringify(plain));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Responses 壳字段', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.include.keys('ret_code', 'ret_msg', 'result', 'time_now');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('ret_msg=ok', () => pm.expect(body.ret_msg).to.eql('ok'));",
                  "pm.test('result 含 token / mustChangePassword', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.result).to.include.keys('token', 'mustChangePassword');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
